Effective immediately, reporting responsibility for Global Strategic Sourcing
(GSS) will move from Corvane Digital to Corvane Energy Inc. Odette Holloway, =
Managing
Director, will report directly to Hollis Castellan, Executive Vice President =
and
Chief Accounting Officer for Corvane. GSS, formed October 6, 2026, will
continue to focus on supply-chain management world-wide for Corvane. We
believe this change in reporting will leverage and enhance GSS's global reach
and effectiveness while allowing CNW to focus on its core mission of creating
new electronic market places.

